 # Rental module (basics)
 
-In-memory service from `createRentalService()` (`src/index.ts`): `addEquipment`, `quote`, `book`.
+In-memory service from `createRentalService()` (`src/index.ts`): `addEquipment`, `quote`, `book` (cancellation: see spec 005).
 
 - Money: integer euro cents. `dailyPrice` must be a non-negative safe integer; total = days x dailyPrice.
 - Times: ISO-8601 UTC strings; a period starts and ends at midnight UTC, start < end, end is the start of the day after the last day.
 - Booked periods are half-open [start, end): back-to-back bookings are fine, overlaps on the same item are rejected.
 - `quote`/`book` throw on unknown item or invalid period; `book` also throws when the item is not free.
